            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>ES6'nın amacı neydi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sorunları düzeltmek ve JS söz dizimini iyileştirmek</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yeni kapsamlar oluşturmak için</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yeni ayrılmış kelimeleri dahil etmek için</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sorunları düzeltmek ve JS söz dizimini iyileştirmek.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni bir JavaScript sürümü eski ve kullanışsız söz dizimini iyileştirmeli, sık kullanılan kodları daha anlaşılır kılmalıdır. ES6 ne amaçla oluşturuldu?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sorunları düzeltmek ve JS söz dizimini iyileştirmek</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yeni kapsamlar oluşturmak için</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yeni ayrılmış kelimeleri dahil etmek için</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">JavaScript'in yerini almak için</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sorunları düzeltmek ve JS söz dizimini iyileştirmek.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 112438,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>age</code> değişkeninin kapsamı nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = i * \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I am &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; years old.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"I am 10 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 20 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 30 years old.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Blok kapsamı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yerel kapsam</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Global Kapsam</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Blok kapsamı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>age</code> bildirimi döngünün süslü parantezleri içinde <code>const</code> kullanıyor. Bu değişken nerede kullanılabilir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" age = i * \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I am &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + age + \" /><text value=\"&quot; years old.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"I am 10 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 20 years old.\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am 30 years old.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Blok kapsamı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yerel kapsam</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Global Kapsam</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Modül Kapsamında</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Blok kapsamı öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 5",
            "id": 112439,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>countdown</code> ne tür bir değişkendir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" countdown = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" countdown--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(countdown);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Genel</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yerel</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Blok</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Genel öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngü <code>countdown</code> değerini değiştiriyor ancak bildirimi döngü başlamadan önce yer alıyor. <code>countdown</code> burada hangi kapsama sahiptir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" countdown = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" countdown--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(countdown);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"0\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Genel</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yerel</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Blok</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Fonksiyon</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Genel öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 9",
            "id": 112461,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hangi değişken bir blok kapsamı içindedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"toggleFeature\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" logMessage = \" /><text value=\"'Feature status: '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (featureEnabled) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Disabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Enabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toggleFeature();\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>action</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>featureEnabled</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>logMessage</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>action</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>toggleFeature</code> içinde, tüm <code>if/else</code> sonrasına <code>console.log(action)</code> ekliyorsun. Ne olur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"toggleFeature\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" logMessage = \" /><text value=\"'Feature status: '\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (featureEnabled) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Disabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" action = \" /><text value=\"'Enabling feature...'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(logMessage + action);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    featureEnabled = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toggleFeature();\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">action kendi dal bloğuyla sınırlı olduğu için ReferenceError oluşur.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bu dal çalıştığı için Disabling feature... kaydedilir.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">featureEnabled artık false olduğu için Enabling feature... kaydedilir.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Bloktan çıkmak action değerini temizlediği için undefined kaydedilir.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">action kendi dal bloğuyla sınırlı olduğu için ReferenceError oluşur.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 112429,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeniden tanımlanamayan veya değeri güncellenemeyen değişken türü hangisidir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>var</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir yapılandırma değerini bir kez ayarlayıp hem yeniden atamayı hem de yeniden bildirmeyi önlemen gerekiyor. Hangi bildirim anahtar sözcüğünü seçmelisin?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>var</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>static</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
