          {
            "title": "Question: Calling an arrow function",
            "id": 103820,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kodu çalıştırmanın sonucu nedir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getRatio = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" first / second;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getRatio(\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>40</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>22</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Argümanların sırasını tersine çevirip <code>getRatio(2, 20)</code> çağırıyorsun. Konsol şimdi ne gösterir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getRatio = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"first, second\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" first / second;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getRatio(\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">0.1</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">10</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">40</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">22</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">0.1 öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
